            "address": "0x1000",
            "points_to": "x",
            "isReference": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "右值引用 (&&)",
        "explanation": "`int&& rref = x + 5` 是右值引用。\n\n临时值 (15) 的生命周期由“rref”延长。这是运动语义的基础。",
        "visualizationType": "cMemory",
        "code": "int&& rref = x + 5;",
        "stack": [
          {
            "name": "x",
            "value": "10",
            "type": "int",
            "address": "0x1000"
          },
          {
